# This module is SHARED — it is promoted process tooling, run against every
# Instatic client from whichever worktree is active. Nothing generated in here
# belongs to the repository: a tracked artifact is one client's output sitting
# on a path every other client also writes to.
#
# Until 2026-09-09 this folder lived at
# deliver/brandklout/dr-nahlah/workflows/15-instatic-api-sync/ and five of
# Dr. Nahlah's outputs (~373KB) were tracked and carried by every branch. They
# are all regenerable; the last tracked copies are in history at the old path.
*
!.gitignore
